(function(E){ const x = E["hr-m7"] = E["hr-m7"] || {units:{}}; x.units["hr-7-1"] = {"explain":{"id":"c-hr-7-1-e","course":"hr","unit":"hr-7-1","type":"explain","level":"B1","title":{"en":"Checks before day one","tr":"İlk günden önceki kontroller","fa":"بررسی‌های قبل از روز اول"},"objective":{"en":"After this lesson, you can explain the checks before a job starts and take up a reference by phone.","tr":"Bu dersin sonunda işe başlamadan önceki kontrolleri açıklayabilecek ve telefonla referans alabileceksin.","fa":"بعد از این درس می‌توانی بررسی‌های قبل از شروع کار را توضیح بدهی و تلفنی از کارفرمای قبلی استعلام بگیری."},"hook":{"en":"Name each check and ask references for facts. This protects the company, and it protects new staff from unfair fees. Rania's offer says 'subject to checks'. She asks what that means, and an agency has asked her for a fee.","tr":"Her kontrolün adını söyle, referanslardan olgu iste. Bu şirketi korur, yeni çalışanı da haksız ücretlerden korur. Rania’nın teklifinde 'kontrollere bağlı' yazıyor. Bunun ne demek olduğunu soruyor; üstelik bir ajans ondan ücret istemiş.","fa":"هر بررسی را نام ببر و در استعلام از معرف واقعیت بخواه. این کار از شرکت محافظت می‌کند و کارمند جدید را هم از هزینه‌های ناعادلانه دور نگه می‌دارد. در پیشنهاد کار رانیا نوشته «subject to checks». می‌پرسد یعنی چه و یک آژانس هم از او پول خواسته."},"before":{"en":"Tell a new hire in two or three sentences which checks come before day one and what they need to send.","tr":"Yeni işe alınan birine iki üç cümleyle ilk günden önce hangi kontrollerin yapılacağını ve ne göndermesi gerektiğini söyle.","fa":"در دو سه جمله به یک استخدامی تازه بگو قبل از روز اول چه بررسی‌هایی انجام می‌شود و او باید چه چیزی بفرستد."},"rounds":[[1,4],[2,3]],"stats":[{"label":{"en":"Key points","tr":"Ana nokta","fa":"نکته‌ی اصلی"},"value":"4"},{"label":{"en":"Key phrases","tr":"Anahtar ifade","fa":"عبارت کلیدی"},"value":"4"},{"label":{"en":"Practice tasks","tr":"Alıştırma","fa":"تمرین"},"value":"4"}],"points":[{"eyebrow":{"en":"The skill","tr":"Beceri","fa":"مهارت"},"head":{"en":"Say what is checked, and ask for facts","tr":"Neyin kontrol edildiğini söyle, olgu iste","fa":"بگو چه چیزی بررسی می‌شود و واقعیت بخواه"},"body":{"en":"Tell the person which checks come before day one and what you need from them. When you call a reference, ask for dates, job title and reason for leaving. Facts can be checked; an opinion can be unfair.","tr":"Kişiye ilk günden önce hangi kontrollerin yapılacağını ve ondan ne istediğini söyle. Bir referansı aradığında tarihleri, unvanı ve ayrılma nedenini sor. Olgular kontrol edilebilir; görüş ise haksız olabilir.","fa":"به آن شخص بگو قبل از روز اول چه بررسی‌هایی انجام می‌شود و از او چه می‌خواهی. در استعلام از معرف، تاریخ‌ها، عنوان شغلی و دلیل رفتن را بپرس. واقعیت را می‌شود بررسی کرد، ولی نظر ممکن است ناعادلانه باشد."}},{"eyebrow":{"en":"The language","tr":"Dil","fa":"زبان"},"head":{"en":"Steps and conditions: the present passive","tr":"Adımlar ve koşullar: present passive","fa":"مرحله‌ها و شرط‌ها: مجهولِ زمان حال"},"steps":[{"en":"A step in the process: is/are + past participle.","tr":"Süreçteki bir adım: is/are + past participle.","fa":"برای یک مرحله از روند، is/are و اسم مفعول می‌آید.","ex":"References are checked before day one."},{"en":"A step already done: was/were + past participle.","tr":"Yapılmış bir adım: was/were + past participle.","fa":"برای مرحله‌ای که انجام شده، was/were و اسم مفعول می‌آید.","ex":"Your certificate was received on Monday."},{"en":"A condition of the offer: subject to + noun.","tr":"Teklifin bir koşulu: subject to + isim.","fa":"برای شرط پیشنهاد کار، subject to و اسم می‌آید.","ex":"The offer is subject to two references."}],"table":{"headers":{"en":["Use","Example"],"tr":["Kullanım","Örnek"],"fa":["کاربرد","مثال"]},"rows":[["A step","Your documents are checked by HR."],["Done","Your reference was received."],["A condition","The offer is subject to a right-to-work check."],["Who pays","All recruitment costs are paid by Atlas."]]},"tip":{"en":"Turkish says 'kontrol edilir' and Persian «بررسی می‌شود». English needs be + past participle: are checked, not check.","tr":"Türkçede 'kontrol edilir' denir. İngilizcede be + past participle gerekir: check değil, are checked.","fa":"در فارسی می‌گوییم «بررسی می‌شود». انگلیسی be و اسم مفعول می‌خواهد: are checked، نه check."},"wrong":"Your references check before day one.","right":"Your references are checked before day one."},{"eyebrow":{"en":"Key phrases","tr":"Anahtar ifadeler","fa":"عبارت‌های کلیدی"},"head":{"en":"Phrases for this task","tr":"Bu görev için ifadeler","fa":"عبارت‌های این کار"},"phrases":[{"phrase":"The offer is subject to...","meaning":{"en":"Names a condition of the offer.","tr":"Teklifin bir koşulunu söyler.","fa":"شرط پیشنهاد کار را می‌گوید."}},{"phrase":"Could you confirm her dates of employment?","meaning":{"en":"Asks a referee for facts.","tr":"Referanstan olgu ister.","fa":"از معرف واقعیت می‌خواهد."}},{"phrase":"You will never be asked to pay a fee.","meaning":{"en":"Says the company pays recruitment costs.","tr":"İşe alım masraflarını şirketin ödediğini söyler.","fa":"می‌گوید هزینه‌ی استخدام با شرکت است."}},{"phrase":"right to work","meaning":{"en":"The legal permission to work in a country.","tr":"Bir ülkede çalışma izni.","fa":"اجازه‌ی قانونی کار در یک کشور."}}]},{"eyebrow":{"en":"At work","tr":"İş yerinde","fa":"در محیط کار"},"head":{"en":"Facts, not opinions; no fees","tr":"Görüş değil olgu; ücret yok","fa":"واقعیت، نه نظر؛ بدون هزینه"},"body":{"en":"Most offers are conditional on checks: the right to work, qualifications and references. A reference gives facts such as dates, job title and reason for leaving. The ILO fair-recruitment principles say workers should never pay recruitment fees, and UAE labour law stops employers from passing these costs to workers.","tr":"Çoğu teklif kontrollere bağlıdır: çalışma izni, belgeler ve referanslar. Referans; tarihler, unvan ve ayrılma nedeni gibi olgular verir. ILO’nun adil işe alım ilkelerine göre çalışanlar hiçbir zaman işe alım ücreti ödememelidir; BAE iş kanunu da işverenin bu masrafları çalışana yüklemesini yasaklar.","fa":"بیشتر پیشنهادهای کار مشروط به بررسی‌اند: اجازه‌ی کار، مدرک‌ها و معرف‌ها. معرف واقعیت‌ها را می‌گوید: تاریخ‌ها، عنوان شغلی و دلیل رفتن. طبق اصول استخدام منصفانه‌ی سازمان بین‌المللی کار (ILO)، کارگر هیچ‌وقت نباید هزینه‌ی استخدام بدهد، و قانون کار امارات هم اجازه نمی‌دهد کارفرما این هزینه‌ها را از کارگر بگیرد."}}],"example":{"eyebrow":{"en":"Worked example","tr":"Çözümlü örnek","fa":"مثال حل‌شده"},"head":{"en":"From weak to strong","tr":"Zayıftan güçlüye","fa":"از شرط مبهم تا بررسی‌های مشخص"},"text":"Facts: The offer needs two references. From the old employer you need job title and dates.","item":"We'll do some checks. Was she a good person?","why":{"en":"Weak: a vague condition and an opinion question. Strong: named checks and factual questions.","tr":"Zayıf: belirsiz bir koşul ve görüş soran bir soru. Güçlü: adı konmuş kontroller ve olgu soran sorular.","fa":"نسخه‌ی اول یک شرط مبهم دارد و سؤالی که نظر می‌خواهد. نسخه‌ی دوم بررسی‌ها را مشخص می‌گوید و درباره‌ی واقعیت‌ها می‌پرسد."},"answer":"Your offer is subject to two references. Could you confirm her job title and dates?","cut":["some checks","Was she a good person?"],"cutHint":{"en":"Tap the vague words and the question that asks for an opinion.","tr":"Belirsiz sözlere ve görüş soran soruya dokun.","fa":"روی کلمه‌های مبهم و سؤالی بزن که نظر شخصی می‌پرسد."}},"quick":{"prompt":"You call a candidate’s last employer for a reference. What do you ask for?","options":["Dates, job title and reason for leaving","Whether they liked her","Her salary there"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"Facts such as dates, job title and reason for leaving: facts can be checked, and an opinion can be unfair.","tr":"Tarihler, unvan ve ayrılma nedeni gibi bilgiler: Bilgiler kontrol edilebilir, bir görüş ise haksız olabilir.","fa":"اطلاعاتی مثل تاریخ‌ها، عنوان شغلی و دلیل رفتن: اطلاعات را می‌شود بررسی کرد، ولی نظر ممکن است ناعادلانه باشد."},"point":1},"remember":{"en":"Who does it does not matter? be + past participle. Result of this lesson: you can explain checks and take a factual reference. You also have the checks email.","tr":"Kimin yaptığı önemli değil mi? be + past participle. Bu dersin sonucu: kontrolleri açıklayıp olgulara dayalı referans alabilirsin ve elinde kontrol e-postası olur.","fa":"مهم نیست چه کسی انجامش می‌دهد؟ پس be و اسم مفعول بیاور. حالا می‌توانی بررسی‌ها را توضیح بدهی و استعلام از معرف را بر پایه‌ی واقعیت انجام بدهی. ایمیل بررسی‌ها هم آماده است."},"b2Point":{"eyebrow":{"en":"B2 track","tr":"B2 yolu","fa":"مسیر B2"},"head":{"en":"Tasks still to do: need to be + past participle","tr":"Yapılacak işler: need to be + past participle","fa":"کارهایی که مانده: need to be با اسم مفعول"},"steps":[{"en":"Something must still happen to it: need(s) to be + past participle.","tr":"Onunla ilgili bir şey hâlâ yapılmalı: need(s) to be + past participle.","fa":"برای کاری که هنوز باید انجام شود، need(s) to be و اسم مفعول می‌آید.","ex":"Your contract needs to be signed by Friday."},{"en":"Make it a question for a deadline: does it need to be...?","tr":"Son tarih için soruya çevir: does it need to be...?","fa":"برای پرسیدن مهلت، سؤالی‌اش کن: does it need to be...?","ex":"Does the form need to be stamped?"},{"en":"Not needed: doesn't need to be + past participle.","tr":"Gerekmiyorsa: doesn't need to be + past participle.","fa":"برای «لازم نیست»، doesn't need to be و اسم مفعول می‌آید.","ex":"Your passport doesn't need to be translated."}],"body":{"en":"B2 track: in your email, use need to be + past participle once.","tr":"B2 yolu: e-postanda need to be + past participle yapısını bir kez kullan.","fa":"مسیر B2: در ایمیلت یک بار need to be را با اسم مفعول به کار ببر."}},"source":{"en":"Based on the ILO fair-recruitment principles and CIPD guidance on pre-employment checks.","tr":"ILO’nun adil işe alım ilkelerine ve CIPD’nin işe giriş öncesi kontroller rehberine dayanır.","fa":"بر پایه‌ی اصول استخدام منصفانه‌ی ILO و راهنمای CIPD درباره‌ی بررسی‌های قبل از استخدام."}},"story":{"id":"c-hr-7-1-s","course":"hr","unit":"hr-7-1","level":"B1","genre":"Workplace","title":{"en":"Before Day One","tr":"İlk Günden Önce","fa":"قبل از روز اول"},"text":"Rania had signed her offer on Sunday. On Tuesday she called Leyla, worried.\n\n\"The letter says the offer is subject to checks. Does that mean you might change your mind?\"\n\n\"Only if something important is wrong,\" Leyla said. \"Three things are checked before day one: your right to work in the UAE, your logistics certificate and two references. Your certificate was received yesterday, so that is done.\"\n\nRania paused. \"There is one more thing. An agency called me. They said I have to pay them a placement fee of two thousand dirhams.\"\n\nLeyla put down her pen. \"Please don't pay anything. At Atlas, all recruitment costs are paid by the company. You will never be asked to pay a fee, by us or by anyone working for us.\"\n\nThat afternoon Leyla called Rania's last manager for a reference. He started warmly. \"Rania? Brilliant planner. A bit stubborn, though, if you know what I mean.\"\n\nLeyla kept her voice friendly. \"Thank you. Could you confirm her dates of employment, her job title and her reason for leaving?\"\n\n\"March 2021 to August 2025. Senior warehouse planner. She left to move to Dubai.\"\n\nLeyla wrote down the facts and nothing else. Stubborn was not a fact.","vocab":[{"word":"subject to","en":"Depending on something happening first.","tr":"bir şeye bağlı, koşuluyla","fa":"مشروط به"},{"word":"placement fee","en":"Money an agency asks for finding you a job.","tr":"yerleştirme ücreti","fa":"هزینه‌ی کاریابی"},{"word":"reference","en":"Information about you from a past employer.","tr":"referans","fa":"معرف؛ گواهی از کارفرمای قبلی"},{"word":"stubborn","en":"Not willing to change your mind.","tr":"inatçı","fa":"لجباز؛ یک‌دنده"}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"Why does Leyla tell Rania not to pay the agency?","options":["The company pays all recruitment costs","The fee is too high","The agency is closed"],"correct":0},{"prompt":"Which sentence describes a check that is already done?","options":["References are checked before day one.","Your certificate was received yesterday.","The offer is subject to checks."],"correct":1},{"prompt":"What does Leyla write down from the reference call?","options":["That Rania is stubborn","Only the dates, the job title and the reason for leaving","Nothing at all"],"correct":1},{"prompt":"How might Rania feel after the call?","options":["Relieved, because she knows what happens next and owes nothing","Angry with Leyla","Sure that the offer will be withdrawn"],"correct":0}],"notice":{"en":"Notice how Leyla describes each check without saying who does it.","tr":"Leyla’nın her kontrolü kimin yaptığını söylemeden nasıl anlattığına dikkat et.","fa":"دقت کن لیلا هر بررسی را بدون گفتن اینکه چه کسی انجامش می‌دهد توضیح می‌دهد."},"bridge":{"en":"Next: make your own reference call.","tr":"Sırada: kendi referans görüşmeni yap.","fa":"قدم بعد: خودت برای استعلام از معرف تماس بگیر."}},"speaking":{"id":"hr-7-1","course":"hr","unit":"hr-7-1","rounds":[90,60],"topic":{"en":"Taking Up a Reference by Phone","tr":"Telefonla Referans Almak","fa":"استعلام تلفنی از معرف"},"warmup":{"en":"Has anyone ever given a reference for you, or asked you for one? What did they want to know?","tr":"Hiç biri senin için referans verdi mi ya da senden referans istedi mi? Ne öğrenmek istediler?","fa":"تا حالا کسی معرف تو شده یا از تو خواسته‌اند معرف کسی بشوی؟ چه چیزی می‌خواستند بدانند؟"},"questions":[{"en":"Introduce yourself and say why you are calling.","tr":"Kendini tanıt ve neden aradığını söyle.","fa":"خودت را معرفی کن و بگو چرا تماس گرفته‌ای."},{"en":"Ask for the candidate's dates of employment and job title.","tr":"Adayın çalışma tarihlerini ve unvanını sor.","fa":"تاریخ‌های کار و عنوان شغلی متقاضی را بپرس."},{"en":"Ask for the reason for leaving.","tr":"Ayrılma nedenini sor.","fa":"دلیل رفتنش را بپرس."},{"en":"The referee gives an opinion (\"a bit difficult\"). Politely bring the call back to facts.","tr":"Referans veren kişi bir görüş bildiriyor (\"biraz zor biri\"). Görüşmeyi kibarca olgulara geri getir.","fa":"معرف یک نظر می‌دهد («a bit difficult»). مؤدبانه گفتگو را به واقعیت‌ها برگردان."}],"followups":[{"en":"Say the whole call out loud in 90 seconds, then in 60. Keep all three facts.","tr":"Görüşmenin tamamını önce 90, sonra 60 saniyede yüksek sesle söyle. Üç bilginin üçünü de koru.","fa":"کل تماس را یک بار در ۹۰ ثانیه و بعد در ۶۰ ثانیه بلند بگو. هر سه واقعیت را نگه دار."},{"en":"Now list the checks a new person needs at your company, in two sentences.","tr":"Şimdi şirketinde işe yeni başlayan birinin hangi kontrollerden geçtiğini iki cümleyle anlat.","fa":"حالا در دو جمله بگو در شرکتت چه بررسی‌هایی برای یک نیروی جدید لازم است."}],"expressions":[{"phrase":"I'm calling about a reference for...","meaning":{"en":"Opens the call and states the purpose.","tr":"Görüşmeyi açar ve amacı söyler.","fa":"تماس را شروع می‌کند و هدف را می‌گوید."}},{"phrase":"Could you confirm her dates of employment?","meaning":{"en":"Asks for a fact.","tr":"Bir olgu ister.","fa":"یک واقعیت را می‌خواهد."}},{"phrase":"Thank you. Just the facts are fine.","meaning":{"en":"Brings the call back from opinions.","tr":"Görüşmeyi görüşlerden olgulara döndürür.","fa":"گفتگو را از نظرها به واقعیت‌ها برمی‌گرداند."}}],"culture":{"en":"Many companies give only factual references (dates, title, reason for leaving), because opinions can be unfair and hard to prove. Note what was said, not what you think it meant.","tr":"Birçok şirket yalnızca olgulara dayalı referans verir (tarihler, unvan, ayrılma nedeni), çünkü görüşler haksız ve kanıtlanması zor olabilir. Ne düşündüğünü değil, söyleneni not et.","fa":"خیلی از شرکت‌ها در استعلام معرف فقط واقعیت‌ها را می‌گویند (تاریخ‌ها، عنوان، دلیل رفتن)، چون نظر ممکن است ناعادلانه باشد و نشود ثابتش کرد. چیزی را بنویس که گفته شد، نه برداشت خودت را."},"model":"Good afternoon, this is Leyla Karimi from Atlas Logistics. I'm calling about a reference for Rania Haddad, who has applied to us as a warehouse planner. Could you confirm her dates of employment and her job title? And could you tell me her reason for leaving? Thank you. Just the facts are fine. Thank you for your time.","selfCheck":[{"en":"I said who I am and why I am calling.","tr":"Kim olduğumu ve neden aradığımı söyledim.","fa":"گفتم کی هستم و چرا تماس گرفته‌ام."},{"en":"I asked for dates and the job title.","tr":"Tarihleri ve unvanı sordum.","fa":"تاریخ‌ها و عنوان شغلی را پرسیدم."},{"en":"I asked for the reason for leaving.","tr":"Ayrılma nedenini sordum.","fa":"دلیل رفتن را پرسیدم."},{"en":"I brought the call back to facts politely.","tr":"Görüşmeyi kibarca olgulara döndürdüm.","fa":"گفتگو را مؤدبانه به واقعیت‌ها برگرداندم."}]},"writing":{"id":"c-hr-7-1-w","course":"hr","unit":"hr-7-1","type":"writing","title":{"en":"The checks email to Rania","tr":"Rania’ya kontroller e-postası","fa":"ایمیل بررسی‌ها به رانیا"},"difficulty":"medium","prompt":{"en":"Write an email to Rania (50-80 words): which checks are done before day one, which one is already finished, what she needs to send, and that she will never pay a fee.","tr":"Rania’ya bir e-posta yaz (50-80 kelime): ilk günden önce hangi kontroller yapılıyor, hangisi bitti, ne göndermesi gerekiyor ve asla ücret ödemeyeceği.","fa":"یک ایمیل به رانیا بنویس (۵۰ تا ۸۰ کلمه): چه بررسی‌هایی قبل از روز اول انجام می‌شود، کدام تمام شده، او چه چیزی باید بفرستد و اینکه هیچ‌وقت هزینه‌ای نمی‌پردازد."},"model":"Hi Rania, thank you for signing your offer. Before your first day, three checks are completed: your right to work, your certificate and two references. Your certificate was received yesterday. Could you send me your visa page by Thursday? Please note that all recruitment costs are paid by Atlas, so you will never be asked to pay a fee. Best wishes, Leyla","frame":"Hi ___, thank you for ___. Before your first day, ___ checks are completed: ___. Your ___ was received ___. Could you send me ___ by ___? Please note that all recruitment costs are paid by ___, so ___. Best wishes, ___","words":[{"word":"subject to"},{"word":"are checked"},{"word":"fee"}],"minWords":50,"minSentences":5,"rubric":["Task done: the checks, the one finished, what to send, no fee","Organised: thanks, checks, request, fee, close","Language: present passive for steps (are checked, was received)","Tone: reassuring and clear"],"rubricI18n":{"tr":["Görev: kontroller, biten kontrol, gönderilecek belge, ücret yok","Düzen: teşekkür, kontroller, rica, ücret, kapanış","Dil: adımlar için present passive (are checked, was received)","Üslup: güven veren ve net"],"fa":["کامل بودن کار: بررسی‌ها، بررسیِ تمام‌شده، مدرکی که باید بفرستد، بدون هزینه","نظم: تشکر، بررسی‌ها، درخواست، هزینه، پایان","زبان: مجهولِ حال برای مرحله‌ها (are checked، was received)","لحن: اطمینان‌بخش و روشن"]},"portfolio":null,"parts":[{"t":{"en":"The checks","tr":"Kontroller","fa":"بررسی‌ها"},"find":["checks","right to work","references"],"sample":"right to work; certificate; two references"},{"t":{"en":"The one already finished","tr":"Tamamlanmış olan","fa":"بررسی‌ای که تمام شده"},"find":["was received","already"],"sample":"certificate received yesterday"},{"t":{"en":"What she needs to send","tr":"Göndermesi gereken","fa":"چیزی که باید بفرستد"},"find":["could you send","by thursday"],"sample":"visa page by Thursday"},{"t":{"en":"No fee, ever","tr":"Asla ücret yok","fa":"هیچ هزینه‌ای در کار نیست"},"find":["fee","paid by atlas","recruitment costs"],"sample":"Atlas pays all recruitment costs"}]},"perspective":{"id":"c-hr-7-1-p","course":"hr","unit":"hr-7-1","type":"perspective","title":{"en":"Through Rania's eyes","tr":"Rania’nın gözünden","fa":"از نگاه رانیا"},"minSentences":2,"prompt":{"en":"You are Rania. You have just read Leyla's email about the checks. Write 2 sentences in first person: what were you worried about, and how do you feel now?","tr":"Sen Rania’sın. Leyla’nın kontrollerle ilgili e-postasını az önce okudun. Birinci tekil şahısla 2 cümle yaz: neyden endişeleniyordun ve şimdi nasıl hissediyorsun?","fa":"تو رانیا هستی و همین حالا ایمیل لیلا درباره‌ی بررسی‌ها را خوانده‌ای. از زبان خودت دو جمله بنویس: نگران چه بودی و حالا چه حسی داری؟"}},"exit":{"id":"c-hr-7-1-x","course":"hr","unit":"hr-7-1","type":"exit","items":[{"from":"hr-7-1","kind":"blank","point":2,"prompt":"Your references ___ before your first day.","options":["are checked","check","are check"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"are checked: the references receive the action, so are + past participle. 'Check' says the references check something, and 'are check' drops -ed.","tr":"are checked: referanslar eylemi alır, bu yüzden are + üçüncü hâl. 'Check' referansların bir şeyi kontrol ettiğini söyler; 'are check' -ed'i düşürür.","fa":"⁨are checked⁩ درست است، چون معرف‌ها بررسی می‌شوند و ⁨are⁩ و اسم مفعول لازم است. ⁨check⁩ یعنی خود معرف‌ها چیزی را بررسی می‌کنند و ⁨are check⁩ ⁨-ed⁩ ندارد."}},{"from":"hr-7-1","kind":"blank","point":2,"prompt":"Your medical form ___ last week.","options":["was received","received","is receive"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"was received: the form received the action last week, so was + past participle. 'Received' alone says the form received something, and 'is receive' is not English.","tr":"was received: form geçen hafta eylemi aldı, bu yüzden was + üçüncü hâl. Tek başına 'received' formun bir şey aldığını söyler; 'is receive' İngilizce değildir.","fa":"was received درست است، چون فرم هفته‌ی پیش دریافت شد و was و اسم مفعول لازم است. received تنها یعنی خود فرم چیزی گرفته و is receive انگلیسی نیست."}},{"from":"hr-7-1","kind":"mcq","point":4,"prompt":"A new driver says an agency wants a fee for his job. What do you tell him?","options":["Don't pay: the employer pays recruitment costs.","Pay half now and half later.","It is normal; everyone pays."],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"Don't pay: the employer pays recruitment costs, and charging workers a fee is a known warning sign of exploitation. 'Pay half' and 'it is normal' accept it.","tr":"Ödeme yapma: işe alım maliyetlerini işveren öder; çalışandan ücret almak bilinen bir sömürü işaretidir. 'Pay half' ve 'it is normal' bunu kabul eder.","fa":"پول نده؛ هزینه‌ی استخدام با کارفرماست و گرفتن پول از کارگر نشانه‌ی شناخته‌شده‌ی بهره‌کشی است. pay half و it is normal این را می‌پذیرند."}},{"from":"hr-6-4","kind":"blank","prompt":"New uniforms ___ in October.","options":["will be given out","will give out","will be give out"],"correct":0,"point":2,"why":{"en":"will be given out: the uniforms receive the action, so will be + past participle. 'Will give out' says the uniforms give something, and 'will be give out' drops the participle.","tr":"will be given out: üniformalar eylemi alır, bu yüzden will be + üçüncü hâl. 'Will give out' üniformaların bir şey dağıttığını söyler; 'will be give out' üçüncü hâli düşürür.","fa":"will be given out درست است، چون لباس‌ها توزیع می‌شوند و will be و اسم مفعول لازم است. will give out یعنی خود لباس‌ها چیزی پخش می‌کنند و will be give out اسم مفعول ندارد."}},{"from":"hr-6-2","kind":"blank","prompt":"If we ___ 8,300, would that work for you?","options":["would offer","offered","will offer"],"correct":1,"point":2,"why":{"en":"offered: a tentative proposal takes if + past, then would. 'Would offer' and 'will offer' can't follow if here.","tr":"offered: kararsız bir öneri if + geçmiş, sonra would alır. 'Would offer' ve 'will offer' burada if'ten sonra gelmez.","fa":"offered درست است، چون پیشنهاد آزمایشی با if و گذشته می‌آید و بعد would. would offer و will offer اینجا بعد از if نمی‌آیند."}},{"from":"hr-3-4","kind":"mcq","prompt":"Which rejection line is kind and clear?","options":["You failed the interview.","Maybe next time, who knows?","I'm afraid that on this occasion we will not be moving forward."],"correct":2,"point":1,"why":{"en":"'I'm afraid that on this occasion we will not be moving forward' is clear and kind. 'You failed' is harsh, and 'Maybe next time, who knows?' is vague.","tr":"'I'm afraid that on this occasion we will not be moving forward' net ve naziktir. 'You failed' serttir; 'Maybe next time, who knows?' belirsizdir.","fa":"«I'm afraid that on this occasion we will not be moving forward» روشن و مهربان است. You failed تند است و «Maybe next time, who knows?» مبهم است."}}]}}; })(globalThis.COURSE_FILES = globalThis.COURSE_FILES || {});
